    <mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Art &amp; culture</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.msn.com/en-gb/news/uknews/the-music-is-black-the-right-exhibition-to-launch-the-v-a-east-museum/ar-AA212gfp?ocid=BingNewsVerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">London is opening a major cultural institution this weekend as the V&amp;A East Museum launches in Stratford’s East Bank</a>. The museum is designed to feel more accessible and rooted in East London than the V&amp;A’s South Kensington site, with local young people and creatives helping shape its identity. It's free permanent galleries mix historic and contemporary objects, while its first paid exhibition, The Music is Black, explores 125 years of black British music and culture.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/news/thelma-and-louise-musical-london-tickets-b2958940.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Young Vic will stage the world premiere of Thelma &amp; Louise: A New Musical as part of its 2026/27 season</a>, bringing the iconic 1991 road movie to the London stage. Callie Khouri, who wrote the original film, has adapted it for the theatre, with music and lyrics by Grammy-nominated singer-songwriter Neko Case and direction by Trip Cullman. Rachel Tucker and Amy Lennox will star as the lead pair.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Sports</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/articles/c624x7wvlv4o" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Manchester City captain Bernardo Silva has confirmed he will leave the club when his contract expires at the end of the season</a>. The 31-year-old Portugal midfielder departs after 451 appearances, 76 goals, 77 assists, and 15 major trophies, including six Premier League titles, a Treble, a domestic quadruple, and the 2017-18 Centurions campaign. Silva thanked fans in an emotional farewell message, saying he leaves not just as a player but as a lifelong supporter of the club.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.bbc.com/sport/snooker/articles/cnv8pzvr1jpo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">The draw for the 2026 World Snooker Championship has set up Ronnie O’Sullivan against China’s Crucible debutant He Guoqiang in the first round</a>. O’Sullivan, chasing a record eighth modern-era world title, will begin his campaign on Tuesday and finish on Wednesday. The tournament starts Saturday at Sheffield’s Crucible, where 32 players will compete over 17 days.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Misc</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
